{"id":"n26149-1-11","stage":1,"title":"중앙 · 正中央","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26149-1-11-1","ko":"선생님. 이 책들을 모두 어디에 둘까요?","zh":"老师，这些书要全部放在哪里呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"선생님.","meaning":"老师，教师","explanation":"선생님：老师，教师","readings":[{"term":"선생님","audio":"/audio/daac5ca7b302bd9b404a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62818","senseId":"1","lemma":"선생님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"책들을","meaning":"书，书籍，画册","explanation":"책：书，书籍，画册；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71468","senseId":"1","lemma":"책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모두","meaning":"全部，所有","explanation":"모두：全部，所有","readings":[{"term":"모두","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64739","senseId":"1","lemma":"모두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디에","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"둘까요?","meaning":"搁，放置，摆放","explanation":"두다：搁，放置，摆放；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"두다","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67470","senseId":"1","lemma":"두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"daac5ca7b302bd9b","term":"선생님","zh":"老师，教师","audio":"/audio/daac5ca7b302bd9b404a.mp3","entryId":"62818","definition":"(敬语)教授学生的人。","pronunciation":["선생님"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"ba928dd573a2db9e","term":"책","zh":"书，书籍，画册","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3","entryId":"71468","definition":"把文章或画印刷之后装订成册而成的物品。","pronunciation":["책"]},{"id":"2576dfb09ecb81b9","term":"모두","zh":"全部，所有","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3","entryId":"64739","definition":"一个不剩或一个不漏的全体。","pronunciation":["모두"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"531b2c3977c491e8","term":"두다","zh":"搁，放置，摆放","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3","entryId":"67470","definition":"放在某处。","pronunciation":["두다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f7637ef01127cd588bfa.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n26149-1-11-2","ko":"건너편 책상의 중앙에 놔두렴.","zh":"把它们放在对面桌子的中央吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"건너편","meaning":"对面","explanation":"건너편：对面","readings":[{"term":"건너편","audio":"/audio/2f7f96cd9c7f8ad9615d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46806","senseId":"1","lemma":"건너편","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"책상의","meaning":"书桌","explanation":"책상：书桌；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"책상","audio":"/audio/e2d1cb559455849bf57e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72039","senseId":"1","lemma":"책상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"중앙에","meaning":"正中央，中心","explanation":"중앙：正中央，中心；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"중앙","audio":"/audio/25c630c275c514680471.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26149","senseId":"1","lemma":"중앙","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"놔두렴.","meaning":"放下，放到","explanation":"놔두다：放下，放到；렴：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"놔두다","audio":"/audio/dd6de8f290629bc419d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28326","senseId":"1","lemma":"놔두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2f7f96cd9c7f8ad9","term":"건너편","zh":"对面","audio":"/audio/2f7f96cd9c7f8ad9615d.mp3","entryId":"46806","definition":"面对着的另一边。","pronunciation":["건ː너편"]},{"id":"e2d1